  "reviewNotes": [
    "Initial batch interrupted by direct user critique: clutter, weak crops and photographic composition, childish illustration treatment.",
    "Studied saved board and enlarged Heyday, Sobo, Ella Ginn, Asahi Nagata, tomato screenprint, and Lucia Calfapietra references; shopping recommendations excluded.",
    "Test stronger edge crops, differentiated scale, fewer props, flat ink silhouettes and economical internal detail.",
    "Direct follow-up rejects plate mess and blue fork against green. Clean-plate v003 removes all food residue and changes fork to paprika.",
    "No direction or production approval inferred. Original fronts untouched."
  ],
  "openWork": [
    "Original set remains incomplete: three carton artwork composites and stoop vignette; original clean-plate vignette replaced by revised study.",
    "Carton scenes remain blank source plates pending answer to deterministic compositing question.",
    "Reassess original batch against revised style before extending."
  ],
